RCNO_PIP^실명확인번호PIP^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="45" _ulen="37" >

IQRY_CSNU^조회건수^11^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock2" occurs="100" inout="out" _len="39" _ulen="31" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="39" _ulen="31" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obaci_acct_307a" title="단기다수개설 출금/고 제한 계좌" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="83" _ulen="63" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="42" _ulen="34" >

PROS_YN^처리여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obaci_nmet_005a" title="비대면 유선업무 신청 (App)" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="545" _ulen="395" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
